  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PA-Reg-JUR support Crowdfunding</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PA-Reg-Setterwalls, 2017-2018, JUR st&#xF6;d Gr&#xE4;srotsfinansiering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Devfin Advisors shall respond to the questions asked by Sida&apos;s lawyers regarding the crowdfunding guarantee initiative and complete a report compiling these questions. Furthermore, the guarantee agreements, in collaboration with Sida and in discussion with the crowdfunding platform, will be finalized.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Devfin Advisors skall svara p&#xE5; de fr&#xE5;gor som st&#xE4;llts av Sidas jurister kring garantiinsatsen till gr&#xE4;srotsfinansiering samt slutf&#xF6;ra den PM som sammanst&#xE4;ller dessa sp&#xF6;rsm&#xE5;l. Vidare skall garantiavtalen i samverkan med handl&#xE4;ggare och i diskussion med gr&#xE4;srotsplattformarna slutf&#xF6;rhandlas och slutf&#xF6;ras.</narrative>
  </description>
